{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"blade-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Blade Snippets","description":"Every Blade directive as a snippet: if, foreach, forelse, switch, include, components, slots, forms, @class, @json and more. Type the prefix (bif, bfor, bcomp...) and press Tab.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Laravel Blade","path":"snippets/laravel-blade.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/laravel-blade.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"@if\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bif\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@if (${1:condition})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endif\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An if block\"\n  },\n  \"@if else\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bife\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@if (${1:condition})\",\n      \"    ${2}\",\n      \"@else\",\n      \"    ${3}\",\n      \"@endif\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An if else block\"\n  },\n  \"@isset\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bisset\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@isset(\\\\$${1:variable})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endisset\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An isset block\"\n  },\n  \"@empty\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bempty\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@empty(\\\\$${1:variable})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endempty\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An empty block\"\n  },\n  \"@unless\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bunless\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@unless (${1:condition})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endunless\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An unless block\"\n  },\n  \"@auth\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bauth\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@auth\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endauth\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Only for signed in users\"\n  },\n  \"@guest\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bguest\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@guest\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endguest\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Only for guests\"\n  },\n  \"@can\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bcan\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@can('${1:update}', \\\\$${2:post})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endcan\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An authorization check\"\n  },\n  \"@foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bfor\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@foreach (\\\\$${1:items} as \\\\$${2:item})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endforeach\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A foreach loop\"\n  },\n  \"@forelse\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bforelse\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@forelse (\\\\$${1:items} as \\\\$${2:item})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@empty\",\n      \"    <p>${3:Nothing found.}</p>\",\n      \"@endforelse\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A forelse loop with an empty case\"\n  },\n  \"@for\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bforl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@for (\\\\$i = 0; \\\\$i < ${1:10}; \\\\$i++)\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endfor\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"@while\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bwhile\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@while (${1:condition})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endwhile\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A while loop\"\n  },\n  \"@switch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bswitch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@switch(\\\\$${1:value})\",\n      \"    @case(${2:1})\",\n      \"        $0\",\n      \"        @break\",\n      \"    @default\",\n      \"        ${3}\",\n      \"@endswitch\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A switch\"\n  },\n  \"@extends\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bext\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@extends('${1:layouts.app}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Extend a layout\"\n  },\n  \"@section\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bsec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@section('${1:content}')\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endsection\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A section\"\n  },\n  \"@yield\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"byield\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@yield('${1:content}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Yield a section\"\n  },\n  \"@include\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"binc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@include('${1:partials.name}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Include a view\"\n  },\n  \"@include with data\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"binca\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@include('${1:partials.name}', ['${2:key}' => \\\\$${3:value}])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Include a view with data\"\n  },\n  \"@includeWhen\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bincw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@includeWhen(${1:condition}, '${2:partials.name}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Include a view when true\"\n  },\n  \"@push\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bpush\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@push('${1:scripts}')\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endpush\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Push to a stack\"\n  },\n  \"@stack\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bstack\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@stack('${1:scripts}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Render a stack\"\n  },\n  \"@props\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bprops\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@props(['${1:type}' => '${2:info}'])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Component props\"\n  },\n  \"@php\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bphp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@php\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"@endphp\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A PHP block\"\n  },\n  \"@csrf\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bcsrf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@csrf\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The CSRF field\"\n  },\n  \"@method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bmethod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@method('${1:PUT}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Method spoofing\"\n  },\n  \"@error\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"berror\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@error('${1:field}')\",\n      \"    <span class=\\\"text-red-600\\\">{{ \\\\$message }}</span>\",\n      \"@enderror\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Show a validation error\"\n  },\n  \"Form\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form method=\\\"POST\\\" action=\\\"{{ route('${1:name}') }}\\\">\",\n      \"    @csrf\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form with CSRF\"\n  },\n  \"Echo\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"be\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ \\\\$${1:variable} }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Escaped output\"\n  },\n  \"Echo raw\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bee\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{!! \\\\$${1:html} !!}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Unescaped output (careful)\"\n  },\n  \"Echo default\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bed\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ \\\\$${1:variable} ?? '${2:default}' }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Output with a default\"\n  },\n  \"Vite\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bvite\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@vite(['resources/css/app.css', 'resources/js/app.js'])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Load assets with Vite\"\n  },\n  \"Component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bcomp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<x-${1:alert} ${2:type=\\\"error\\\"}>\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"</x-${1:alert}>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use a component\"\n  },\n  \"Slot\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bslot\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<x-slot:${1:title}>\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"</x-slot>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A named slot\"\n  },\n  \"@class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bclass\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@class(['${1:p-4}', '${2:font-bold}' => \\\\$${3:isActive}])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Conditional classes\"\n  },\n  \"@json\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bjson\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@json(\\\\$${1:data})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Print a value as JSON\"\n  },\n  \"@lang\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"blang\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ __('${1:messages.welcome}') }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A translation\"\n  },\n  \"Pagination\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"bpage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ \\\\$${1:items}->links() }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Pagination links\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Blade Snippets\n\nEvery Blade directive as a snippet: if, foreach, forelse, switch, include, components, slots, forms, @class, @json and more. Type the prefix (bif, bfor, bcomp...) and press Tab.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 37 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Laravel Blade | `bif` | An if block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bife` | An if else block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bisset` | An isset block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bempty` | An empty block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bunless` | An unless block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bauth` | Only for signed in users |\n| Laravel Blade | `bguest` | Only for guests |\n| Laravel Blade | `bcan` | An authorization check |\n| Laravel Blade | `bfor` | A foreach loop |\n| Laravel Blade | `bforelse` | A forelse loop with an empty case |\n| Laravel Blade | `bforl` | A for loop |\n| Laravel Blade | `bwhile` | A while loop |\n| Laravel Blade | `bswitch` | A switch |\n| Laravel Blade | `bext` | Extend a layout |\n| Laravel Blade | `bsec` | A section |\n| Laravel Blade | `byield` | Yield a section |\n| Laravel Blade | `binc` | Include a view |\n| Laravel Blade | `binca` | Include a view with data |\n| Laravel Blade | `bincw` | Include a view when true |\n| Laravel Blade | `bpush` | Push to a stack |\n| Laravel Blade | `bstack` | Render a stack |\n| Laravel Blade | `bprops` | Component props |\n| Laravel Blade | `bphp` | A PHP block |\n| Laravel Blade | `bcsrf` | The CSRF field |\n| Laravel Blade | `bmethod` | Method spoofing |\n| Laravel Blade | `berror` | Show a validation error |\n| Laravel Blade | `bform` | A form with CSRF |\n| Laravel Blade | `be` | Escaped output |\n| Laravel Blade | `bee` | Unescaped output (careful) |\n| Laravel Blade | `bed` | Output with a default |\n| Laravel Blade | `bvite` | Load assets with Vite |\n| Laravel Blade | `bcomp` | Use a component |\n| Laravel Blade | `bslot` | A named slot |\n| Laravel Blade | `bclass` | Conditional classes |\n| Laravel Blade | `bjson` | Print a value as JSON |\n| Laravel Blade | `blang` | A translation |\n| Laravel Blade | `bpage` | Pagination links |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}